    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1147-a1">

                <pb facs="1036" n="722" sameAs="frus:frus1914Supp/pg722"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in France</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Herrick</hi>)</head>

                <opener>
                    <dateline>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1914-08-12">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 12, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Certificates of identity may be issued to persons holding first papers, provided
                    seven years have not elapsed and residence of a permanent nature has not been
                    acquired abroad since they were obtained. Inform Consulate General.</p>
                <p rendition="#right">
                    
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi>
                    
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
